<title>FRANCE: Usinor-Sacilor to become Usinor.</title>
<headline>Usinor-Sacilor to become Usinor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Usinor-Sacilor is to be known from now on as Usinor, the French steel company announced on Monday.</p>
<p>The name Usinor &quot;is already widely used in the press and financial world&quot;, Usinor chairman Francis Mer told shareholders at the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 mbl/pmc</p>
